  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution Agreement with UNIDO - Enhancing Business Intermediary Organizations&#xb4; Support Services for MSMEs Competitiveness in Paraguay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Action will strengthen the institutional capacity of the BIO to extend high-quality business development services to MIPYMEs, improve MSMEs technology access and foster innovation process and Ehnance institutional capacitiies to support MSMEs in selected sectors to comply with buyer/market requirements and operate at competitive levels..&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
